# MetroD3 D3 visual

- Use D3 7 `hierarchy`, `partition`, and `arc` as in https://observablehq.com/@d3/zoomable-sunburst.
- Keep one SVG; rebuild on data/format signature change; remove it in `destroy()`.
- Category field wells build a `{ name, children, value }` tree. Landing page uses the flare sample.
- Format pane must persist with no data: `supportsEmptyDataView`, `selector: null`, `forceNullSelectors`, `applyFormattingObjects`.
- JSON URLs need `WebAccess` and CORS. Work in `MetroD3/`; run `pbiviz` from that folder.
